    'Clearpay' => 'Clearpay',
    'Affirm\'s tailored Buy Now Pay Later programs remove price as a barrier, turning browsers into buyers, increasing average order value, and expanding your customer base.' => 'Affirm-ovi prilagođeni programi „Kupi sada, plati kasnije“ uklanjaju cenu kao prepreku, pretvarajući posetioce u kupce, povećavajući prosečnu vrednost porudžbine i šireći vašu bazu kupaca.',
    'Credit/debit cards, Apple Pay, Google Pay, and more.' => 'Kreditne/debitne kartice, Apple Pay, Google Pay i još mnogo toga.',
